---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="How to Play Krillion: Official Rules, Scoring Algorithm & Depth Guide - Krillion.si"
  description="Master the official rules of Krillion. Learn how reverse-trivia mechanics work, how ocean trench depth is calculated, and step-by-step instructions to plunge past 7,000 meters."
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 prose prose-invert prose-cyan">
    <div class="mb-8">
      <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-abyss-cyan mb-2">Rules & Game Guide</div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white leading-tight">
        How to Play Krillion: Rules, Mechanics & Scoring Algorithm
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-3">
        Official Documentation • Updated October 2026 • 6 min read
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Rules Summary Box (Optimized for AI & Snippets) -->
    <div class="bg-abyss-card border border-cyan-500/30 rounded-2xl p-6 my-8 not-prose space-y-3">
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>📋</span> Quick Summary: Krillion at a Glance
      </h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-300">
        <li><strong>Objective:</strong> Reach maximum depth (up to 7,000 meters per prompt, 49,000m total) across 7 category prompts.</li>
        <li><strong>Core Rule:</strong> Valid answers are scored by <em>rarity</em>. Popular answers score shallow; obscure answers plunge deepest.</li>
        <li><strong>Time Limit:</strong> 60 seconds per prompt. Unanswered prompts score 0m.</li>
        <li><strong>Game Modes:</strong> Daily Dive (1 synchronized set every 24h) and Endless Dive (unlimited free practice).</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>Step-by-Step Gameplay Walkthrough</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <strong>Read the Category Prompt:</strong> Each round presents a prompt from history, geography, science, literature, or popular culture (e.g., <em>"A sovereign nation located in the Southern Hemisphere"</em>).
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Analyze the Crowd Consensus:</strong> Ask yourself what answer 80% of players will type first (e.g., <em>Australia</em> or <em>Brazil</em>). Discard it immediately!
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Submit a Valid Obscure Answer:</strong> Type an answer that is factually accurate but recalled by only a tiny minority of participants (e.g., <em>Nauru</em> or <em>Tuvalu</em>).
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Receive Depth Evaluation:</strong> The engine scores your depth based on real-time community frequency logs.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Share Your Dive Grid:</strong> After 7 rounds, copy your color-coded emoji breakdown to social platforms to compare with friends.
      </li>
    </ol>

    <h2>The Depth Scoring Algorithm Explained</h2>
    <p>
      Unlike binary trivia where answers are either right or wrong, Krillion implements a multi-tiered algorithmic depth curve:
    </p>

    <div class="not-prose my-6 overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full text-xs text-left bg-abyss-card rounded-2xl border border-white/10 overflow-hidden">
        <thead class="bg-white/5 uppercase text-slate-400">
          <tr>
            <th class="p-3">Depth Tier</th>
            <th class="p-3">Frequency Percentile</th>
            <th class="p-3">Badge</th>
            <th class="p-3">Player Verdict</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-white/5">
          <tr>
            <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-blue-400">0m - 1,500m</td>
            <td class="p-3 text-slate-300">&gt; 35% of players</td>
            <td class="p-3 font-mono">🌊 Surface Floater</td>
            <td class="p-3 text-slate-400">Valid, but swallowed by the crowd consensus.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-amber-400">2,500m - 4,500m</td>
            <td class="p-3 text-slate-300">5% - 35% of players</td>
            <td class="p-3 font-mono text-amber-300">⚠️ Too-Clever Trap</td>
            <td class="p-3 text-slate-400">Clever answer, but dozens of other smart players had the same idea.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-cyan-300">5,000m - 6,500m</td>
            <td class="p-3 text-slate-300">0.5% - 5% of players</td>
            <td class="p-3 font-mono">⚓ Twilight Sinker</td>
            <td class="p-3 text-slate-400">High-tier trivia recollection. Rare and deep.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-abyss-cyan">7,000m (Max)</td>
            <td class="p-3 text-slate-300">&lt; 0.05% of players</td>
            <td class="p-3 font-mono text-abyss-cyan font-bold">👑 Hadal Abyss</td>
            <td class="p-3 text-slate-400">Flawless obscure knowledge. Maximum possible round score.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="space-y-4 not-prose my-6">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/5">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">What happens if my answer is factually incorrect?</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">If an answer is incorrect or unverified, you score 0 meters for that prompt and receive a missed depth penalty.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/5">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">Can I play Krillion more than once per day?</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Yes! While the official Daily Dive resets every 24 hours, you can play unlimited rounds in our <a href="/endless" class="text-abyss-cyan underline">Endless Practice Mode</a> without any lockout.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-abyss-card border border-cyan-500/30 text-center not-prose space-y-4">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white">Put the Rules Into Practice</h3>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 pt-2">
        <a href="/daily" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-abyss-cyan to-blue-600 text-abyss-dark font-extrabold text-sm hover:scale-105 transition-all">
          Play Today's Daily Dive ⚓
        </a>
        <a href="/how-to-dive-7000m" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-bold text-sm transition-all border border-white/10">
          Advanced 7,000m Strategy Guide →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
